      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im having some really bad pain in my side on the right, kinda goes down towards my groin. its pretty intense. i had kidney stones last year so i think its probably just that happening again but i also noticed a weird pulsing feeling in my stomach area while i was lying down. is it just the stones or should i be worried?",
