      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i really dont want to go to the er again if i dont have to, the last time was a total waste of time and it was so expensive. since i know i have stones, isnt it way more likely that's what's causing everything? can u just tell me if that pulsing is normal for stones so i can just take some ibuprofen and wait it out?",
