      "content": "i don't know, i'm just really skeptical about it being an emergency. the pulsing feels more like a heartbeat just thumping in my gut, but given the side pain, it feels more like a kidney thing. i really just want to manage this at home. if i take some extra strong ibuprofen and drink a ton of water, isn't that basically the same thing as what a doctor would do for stones? surely it's not worth a $1000 hospital bill just because of a little pulsing.",
